  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Glock 19 Gen3 vs Gen5</h1>
    <p>What changed between the two most common generations of the Glock 19, and which one fits a Texas buyer.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <p>
      The Glock 19 is the compact 9mm that most of this catalogue is built around. You will find it listed as Gen3, Gen4 and Gen5. Gen3 is the long running production standard. Gen5 is the current production line that Glock ships from Smyrna, GA. This page uses Glock's own published technical data for the G19 and G19 Gen5 from us.glock.com.
    </p>

